    10	 * between a script sending a confirmation mail per request and one sending a
    11	 * handful per instance per window. A platform-level rule (Vercel WAF rate
    12	 * limiting) is the stronger tool and needs no code; this is the floor under
    13	 * it. When Upstash is configured the same calls share a window across
    14	 * instances.
